		(descr "Preliminary underside interface for ALAMSCN black VL53L0X-V2, ASIN B0DGL2P6XC. Carrier-side socket: Samtec SSW-106-01-T-S (1x6, 2.54mm pitch, THT, lead-free solderable). Pad pitch/drill/courtyard verified against Samtec's published SSW/SSQ mechanical drawing (2.54mm pitch; body length = 2.54mm x N + 0.51mm = 15.75mm for 6 positions, vs. 15.70mm drawn here; single-row body width = 2.41mm / .095in per Samtec's TH SSW drawing; 1.0mm drill matches KiCad's standard 2.54mm pin-socket land pattern) -- reused, not replaced. Mates with the breakout's own male header pins, no separate header part selected.")
